{"ticker":"COST","updated":"2026-10-23T22:48:29Z","profile":{"longName":"Costco Wholesale Corporation","shortName":"Costco Wholesale Corporation","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Discount Stores","country":"United States","website":"https://www.costco.com","fullTimeEmployees":355000,"marketCap":444600549376,"trailingPE":48.32948,"forwardPE":40.090595,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.4665831,"pegRatio":5.1,"targetMeanPrice":1067.5946,"targetHighPrice":1315.0,"targetLowPrice":770.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.111,"earningsGrowth":0.15,"grossMargins":0.12765999,"operatingMargins":0.037890002,"profitMargins":0.03043,"totalRevenue":303154003968,"beta":0.87,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1096.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":844.06,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.58},"summary":"Costco Wholesale Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the operation of membership warehouses in the United States, Puerto Rico, Canada, Mexico, Japan, the United Kingdom, Korea, Australia, Taiwan, China, Spain, France, Sweden, Iceland, and New Zealand. It offers merchandise, including sundries, dry groceries, candies, coolers, freezers, liquor, and tobacco; non-food merchandise comprising consumer electronics, appliances, small electrics, health and beauty aids, hardware, lawn and garden, sporting goods, tires, toys and seasonal, automotive, stamps, tickets, apparel, furniture, domestics, housewares, special order kiosks, and jewelry; and fresh food, such as meat, produce, deli, and bakery products. The company is also involved in warehouse ancillary operations, which include gasoline, pharmacies, food courts, optical, hearing aids, and tire installation centers. In addition, it engages in e-commerce, business centers, travel, and other businesses. Further, the company operates e-commerce sites; and offers branded and private-label products in various categories. The company was formerly known as Costco Companies, Inc. and changed its name to Costco Wholesale Corporation in August 1999. Costco Wholesale Corporation was founded in 1976 and is based in Issaquah, Washington.","summary_zh":"Costco Wholesale Corporation 及其子公司在美國、波多黎各、加拿大、墨西哥、日本、英國、韓國、澳洲、台灣、中國、西班牙、法國、瑞典、冰島和紐西蘭從事會員倉庫的營運。它提供的商品包括雜貨、乾貨、糖果、冷卻器、冰櫃、酒類和煙草；非食品商品，包括消費電子產品、電器、小型電器、健康和美容用品、五金、草坪和花園、體育用品、輪胎、玩具和季節性產品、汽車、郵票、門票、服裝、家具、家居用品、家居用品、特殊食品訂購和珠寶；該公司還從事倉庫輔助業務，包括汽油、藥房、美食廣場、眼鏡、助聽器和輪胎安裝中心。此外，也從事電子商務、商務中心、旅遊等業務。此外，該公司還經營電子商務網站；並提供各種類別的品牌和自有品牌產品。該公司前身為 Costco Companies, Inc.，於 1999 年 8 月更名為 Costco Wholesale Corporation。 Costco Wholesale Corporation 成立於 1976 年，總部位於華盛頓州伊瑟闊。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"折扣店","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":954.96,"h":958.3,"l":940.56,"c":941.58,"v":2284300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":941.34,"h":944.05,"l":933.25,"c":941.34,"v":4341300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":940.49,"h":952.0,"l":937.22,"c":949.52,"v":1893600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":950.29,"h":951.0,"l":944.13,"c":944.96,"v":2067900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":945.0,"h":948.61,"l":940.46,"c":943.32,"v":1609000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":938.66,"h":944.51,"l":936.58,"c":938.82,"v":1793900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":939.0,"h":950.09,"l":936.5,"c":949.78,"v":1670500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":953.4,"h":959.5,"l":951.11,"c":955.9,"v":1471900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":958.71,"h":969.55,"l":956.22,"c":963.48,"v":1928500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":963.73,"h":972.34,"l":958.59,"c":971.85,"v":1737000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":970.0,"h":979.87,"l":963.11,"c":979.25,"v":1496800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":976.39,"h":981.0,"l":953.96,"c":956.29,"v":2277500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":957.8,"h":965.16,"l":954.28,"c":964.32,"v":1532000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":960.29,"h":969.57,"l":960.0,"c":967.9,"v":1461600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":967.82,"h":969.74,"l":959.71,"c":960.1,"v":2199400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":959.1,"h":959.58,"l":950.8,"c":952.07,"v":2012600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":953.49,"h":963.98,"l":953.49,"c":963.03,"v":1556800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":957.37,"h":962.54,"l":950.67,"c":952.36,"v":18